flowchart TB
accTitle: A health gate separates each rolling patch batch
accDescr: A small batch is drained, receives approved patches and required reboots, and returns only after validation. A failed health check stops rollout while the remaining healthy fleet serves customers.
B[Select a small patch batch<br/>Other instances keep serving]:::inputData --> D[Drain application traffic]:::process
D --> P[Install approved patches<br/>Reboot when required]:::process
P --> H{Application healthy?}:::decision
H -->|Yes| R[Return batch to service<br/>Then select the next batch]:::output
H -->|No| S[Stop rollout<br/>Investigate or recover batch]:::warning
